    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλιρ-ρόθιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>back-rushing, refluent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δέ
