				Od.
				5.430
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤπειρόνδε π. φέρε
			κῦμα</span>, of the wave caused by the rock thrown by the
			Cyclops, <i><span class="en">
				9.485
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενίης κῦμα π.</span>”
