					Luc.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			: generally, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίρροος, ναῦς π.</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				347
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίρροια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1170
			</span></i>.</div>
